    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d522">

                <pb facs="0536" n="502" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg502"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-02-20"><hi rendition="#italic">February 20,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs just received telegram from Cuba stating that the
                    Mayor Sagua acted through mistake and that specific instructions given to
                    prevent such occurrence in future.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
